            "videoLink": "",
            "desc": "5:30 | Lap & Setup: 1 lap. 5 lines @ 5 yds apart (new players to back line; pair up/no one alone; uneven goes to prior line).\n5:33‚Äì5:48 | Part 1: Expanded Lines\n     Init: Clap up | Stance: Feet-Sink-Holsters (20s x2).\n            Calisthenics (x10): Jumping Jacks, Seal Jacks, Squats, Jumps in place, Push-Ups (knees ok), Leg Raises (hold), Butt Raises w/ wrap.\n            Footwork: Feet chop + COD calls (MS, HS, Falls, Turf). Finish with 2 burpees, condense lines.\nPart 2: Condensed Lines (Rule: Breakdown stance every time, catch a football every rep)\nDynamics (1-way): High Knees, Butt Kicks, Frankensteins.\nBackpedals: Long & Short Step (Open to HS on 2nd whistle).\nSideways: 1st whistle = Breakdown, 2nd = Turn, 3rd = Run.\nPursuit & Contact (Split Skill & OL): Bear crawl to roll/pop-up | Pursuit angle (cone to breakdown/swoop/drive 5) | Lobsters | Swoop Drill (Breakdown-Sprint-Swoop-Full Stop).\nHands & Turnovers: Catching (Mid=Diamond, Low=Pinkies Down, High=Attack Peak) | Fumble Drill (Low squat, pick up/return; miss = FALL ON IT) | Tip Drill (Tip backward to man, runner to back).\n",
